;;   findInternedVar}  property $STAR$e here and _STAR_e there
;;   eval, *eval*   self-hosted ClojureScript's entry point
;;
;; clojure.cljs.analyzer/removed-core-vars carries the same list as the sentence a
;; program naming one of them gets.

